  Description: The orcs have had a long history of violence that brings some orcs
    pride, but for you it's a mark of shame. You see the path of reconciliation that
    Ardax is paving and find hope in the chance to transform your people's ways into
    one that moves away from stereotypes of brutality. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Charisma or Strength , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Intimidation skill and the Belkzen Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick
    Coercion] skill feat.
